"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf d\\cap\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf d\\cap\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}inv}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf d].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}inv}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf d].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿对任意 ≥0′ 度要求 c.e. 原像，遗漏“c.e. in 0′”。任何 c.e. A≤0′，故 A′ 有 0′-c.e. 代表，说明这个范围条件必要；反向是 Sacks 反演的书外构造，仍待核实。</p>\n<p>来源：既有跳跃反演的范围修复；原始论文与证明待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"ta